Exhaust (apps/p96_exhaust: exlink.js, flap.js, rules.js, main.js) adapts the exhaust flap control of
idrive7-apps' Engine Config (apps/live_adjustments: controller.js, adapters.js, real_adapters.js,
diaglink.js, auto.js) and the gear decoding of its kit (kit/runtime/car.js): the flap requests, the
probe of the engine units, the hold and the safety model. Those parts are used under the MIT license
below (Copyright (c) 2026 cauliflowermossgrape); the files say which parts they are.

This repository contains a vendored copy of the kit from idrive7-apps, in upstream-kit/:
  https://github.com/cauliflowermossgrape/idrive7-apps
